{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act15d5_level_act15d5_st04",
  "groupId": "act15d5",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "信仰号街车",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st04.txt",
  "sourceHash": "56fb2e1c44512a25baa82433051cc6ac0cdf93bbbacd7ee69a32c938db047a06",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我们的姐妹，席德佳。今日，我们将为你送行。\n愿光芒铺陈你的前路，愿虔诚与信念永伴你身。\n兰登修道院的钟声将穿过漫长......呃？什么？\n咳，兰登修道院的钟声将穿过漫长的岁月，将这数百年来的......葡萄酒！？\n喂，怎么还剩下葡萄酒？哪来......呃，瞒着老头子偷偷带来的？嘘！嘘！\n总而言之愿兰登百年的荣光与你同在！席德佳！快来帮忙！帮忙把酒桶撬开！\n嘿嘿，送别的话果然还是少不了这个吧？在老头子回来之前，干杯！\n......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "啊......我睡着了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "有人在敲门......已经这个点了！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "早安，席德佳修士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......早安，或者说午安，拜松先生，久违地躺在床上，我似乎有些懈怠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "长途劳累，辛苦您了。我是来向您确认今天的行程的，没有打扰到您休息吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "没有的事，也辛苦你们了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "从拉特兰......那个遥远的国家来到龙门，不是一场轻松的旅途吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "这是我第一次离开拉特兰这么远......原来长途旅行，不止是欣赏风景那么简单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "哈哈，就算是经验老道的信使，也会选择各种各样的办法排解情绪......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "信使们也很不容易呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那席德佳小姐，请问昨晚的住宿还满意吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "嗯。距离市中心很近，价格也很便宜，你的眼光很不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "其实费用这方面，您不用担心的。峯驰物流会报销您在龙门期间的出行费用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不，作为兰登修道院的一员，我并不愿在财富上仰仗他人，请原谅。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "更何况，我正是为了解决修道院的各种难题才远走他乡，总不能过分奢求别人的地主之谊，自己享乐吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "是这样......真是令人钦佩的精神。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "只是必修课罢了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "和欧厄尔先生的会面安排在明天晚上，那请问您今天有什么打算吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唔......在附近稍微逛逛吧。这还是我第一次来大炎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "这样的话，需要安排导游或是随行人员吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "啊，不。我想自己随便看看。只是满足自己的好奇心而已，不好麻烦各位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "如果是这样的话......我也就不打扰您的雅兴了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "感谢理解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......冒昧地问一下，欧厄尔先生，是您的父亲，是吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "嗯？啊，是的，怎么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不，是我失礼了。只是拜松先生在工作的时候，完全把欧厄尔先生当做上司看待......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "啊，如果我总是依赖着老爹这层关系的话，那还怎么越过他这道高墙呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......哈哈，拜松先生原来也是个很有野心的人嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "哪里，要不是和席德佳修士聊得来，我也不会和客户说这种话题喔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "那么，不打扰您了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "不过如果您有空的话，我想听听拉特兰的故事。就像您对龙门的好奇心一样，我对那里......也有着各种想象。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拜松",
      "text": "好，祝您今天玩得愉快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......龙门吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "虽然没有什么旅游经费......随便逛逛吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "毕竟“机遇和信仰，都在集市与钟声里”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门男性",
      "text": "你爹太顽固啦！这里可是龙门哎！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门女性",
      "text": "可这手艺，是我们老家那边代代传下来的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门男性",
      "text": "这都什么年代了，手工怎么挣钱嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门女性",
      "text": "......也对。那是得说服说服我爹去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门男性",
      "text": "还有几号排到我们？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "龙门女性",
      "text": "21号，快了，马上就到我们了。这家甜品店怎么这么火啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......我是31号啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "好甜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "欸......您、您是不是拉特兰来的那位客人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "嗯？您知道我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "啊，是，其实因为某些原因我家现在住不了人，近卫局给我安排的住所和您是同一家酒店......呃，其实就在您的对面......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "原来是这样......那还真是巧合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "啊，失礼，我该先做自我介绍的。我是拉特兰兰登修道院所属，请叫我席德佳。您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "不不不用尊称的，我只是一个普通的工程师......工程师代号是雪雉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "......不过，您这样身份的人，为什么不住在更高级一点的套房里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "啊哈哈......我也有点苦衷啦，不过更多的是为了提醒自己。也不用对我这么客气，现在我只是在旅游中而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "给，你要吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "这是......小蛋糕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "本来看很有名，就多买了两个，没想到口味会这么激烈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不过，如果这样的东西能广受欢迎的话，也许修道院的一些商品未必适合龙门呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "真的可以给我吗！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "欸？啊，可以啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "谢、谢谢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "（怎么像饿了三天的瘤兽似的......）咳咳，吃慢点啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......雪雉，是吧？能不能陪我多走一段路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "咕，哈。没、没问题大人！今天我休假！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "别、别喊大人啦，有点不好意思......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不知不觉，已经到夜里了啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "听不见钟声的日子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "席德佳姐姐，怎么了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "啊，没有。只是觉得时间过得真快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "毕竟今天是休息日，堵车太严重了，只是稍微在龙门市中心逛一逛，就天黑啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......雪雉，哥伦比亚又是个什么样的地方？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "唔？我想想......总、总之一切都亮闪闪的，科技感很强，而且......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "有点不近人情......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "当、当然，我只在研究所和周围的地方待过，不如说离开工作地点两公里以外的地方就完全没有去过！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呜呜，那段两点一线的生活......胃不舒服......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "哈哈......当我没说，别勉强自己啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "......席德佳姐姐，兰登修道院......是什么样的地方？我只听说过公证所......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......面包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "面包？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "是一座建立在麦田和山丘之上的，古老的修道院。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "起初是为了训练保卫教宗的战士，与公证所和教宗骑士最大的不同在于，兰登修道院接纳来自大地各国的人们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "咕，但是......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "但是这几年太和平了！公证所基本把我们工作抢光了！今年连一个新生都没有！老头子们也说着要让修道院学会自力更生而拒绝拨款！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......要倒闭了啊。历史悠久的兰登修道院要因为财政问题倒闭了啊！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "席德佳姐姐，修道院该用倒闭这个词吗......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......这个词太贴切了，没办法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "咳咳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "所以席德佳姐姐才离开了拉特兰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......总得想想办法啊。幸亏修道院的名声在外，虽然有些人觉得我们只剩下些花架子，但起码我们还有一大片麦田......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "今天麻烦你了，雪雉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "没、没关系！今天本来就没有别的安排......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我就在152房，如果姐姐有什么别的事的话，可以来找我......在家里打扫完之前，我都会住在这里的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "啊，席德佳修士，欢迎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "欧厄尔先生，很荣幸能与您会面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "没有的事，放轻松些，席德佳修士，我们的企业文化不喜欢过于拘谨的会面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "好的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "那么，关于从兰登修道院来往龙门的商业条款——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......您很厉害。您早就准备好了所有的规划，其实今天，只是告诉我这一切而已，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哪里的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......太完美了。只靠我如今的见识，完全没办法在信使相关的工作上与您相提并论。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哈哈哈，能得到拉特兰修道院修士的认可，是我的荣幸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "欧厄尔先生，请恕我冒昧，我想以个人名义问您几个问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "为什么选择兰登修道院？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "如果是峯驰物流这样体量的公司，想铺设信使通道、完善系统程序的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哪里的话，能与兰登修道院这样悠久的机关合作，我们深感荣幸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "——您知道，一家物流公司所能触及到的极限距离吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "即使是我的峯驰物流，也不过触及到龙门及周围五座大炎城邦而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......乌萨斯或者维多利亚呢？龙门是大炎的重要对外枢纽，那么国外的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "和大部分普通市民所想的不同，物流公司其实极难在注册国以外的地区有任何发挥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "即使合法过境后，大部分民事物流公司业务都会转交给当地的合作方或政府信使机构，可没有哪个国家宽容到纵容别国信使在自家地盘随便乱窜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "当然......这只是“明面上”的运作模式，不过灰色的部分并不在我们需要探讨的范畴之内，不用介意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "原来是这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "诚如您所说，在信息、中转等各方面建立起稳定的链接所需要的成本，和修道院带来的商品利润是完全不成正比的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "仅仅是天灾信使驻扎基站这一项成本，就高得惊人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "但是，这是一条连通向拉特兰的道路。您应该明白这其中的意义。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "这只是我所希望的蓝图的其中一环，而在这条道路的尽头，信使们将会翻过文化与种族的壁垒，我们的双手将可以触及整片大地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "我知道，因为各种各样的原因，这件事几乎不可能实现。种族，文化，历史，还有时不时来添麻烦的天灾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "这片大地上有太多因素决定了各国不可能打成一团。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "也许我们要熬过战争，要对抗天灾，也许这件事根本不可能在这片分离且隔阂的大地上顺利推进——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "但这并不代表......桥梁不被允许存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "既然如此，我们就该先试着分开巨浪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "通过某些手段，我了解到......教宗本人似乎对这类想法的态度非常宽容，因此，拉特兰也许是我们某个尝试方向的第一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "席德佳修士？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不，抱歉，我没想到能听到如此的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......您的儿子知道您的这份，呃，宏伟蓝图吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "当然不，他还需要磨炼。我说过，这份事业绝非一朝一夕，我不会是那个亲手搭建桥梁的人，也许他是。也许，他也不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "但他可是我的儿子，这就够了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......兰登修道院能与贵司合作，将会是一次宝贵的经验。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "我深感荣幸，席德佳修士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......说实话，欧厄尔先生，我的想法很简单。我很喜欢我的修道院，我也认为兰登修道院优良的文化值得延续。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "所以，我不希望它断绝于此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "与您的期望相比，我们的出发点似乎有些自私自利了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "绝非如此，席德佳修士。衷心认可并呵护自己热爱的家园，这绝非一件小事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "——而您也不必担心会为修道院带来许多麻烦，兰登修道院的立场仅仅是兰登修道院，仅此而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "呵呵，我可没有这个意思，欧厄尔先生多虑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哪里，席德佳修士才是，我在您这个年纪，可做不到您这么沉稳冷静。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "时候不早了，明天我们还会为席德佳修士准备一场晚宴，在此之前，请好好休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......好顺利啊。真是个厉害的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唉，好像没我什么事了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我自己能做些什么呢。\n不知道啊。\n找份工作？可要怎么样才能迅速地......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "呜——怎、怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "怎么每次都会变成这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "你也该习惯了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "习惯在工作途中因为一些意外的爆炸而成为众人瞩目的焦点吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可颂",
      "text": "慢着......我看见他了！小偷！别想跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "哇啊......这是抓小偷该有的阵仗吗......偷了什么东西，这么不得了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "哪位？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "是我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "请进！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "啊......没有打扰姐姐休息吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "没有，有什么事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "......那、那个，只是一个人有有有点不知道干什么，毕竟昨天的这个时候，我都在忙着改进我的小型清洁无人机23号......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......23号？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "哎，嗯，是的，因为想要试做更简单的源石电路，结果把窗帘点着了......那个......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呜呜......虽然买了保险......但卡里的余额又......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "好、好啦，没关系，其实你来的正好，你认识下面那群人吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "下面？说起来，刚才就好吵......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "text": "德克萨斯！往你那边去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "唔啊啊......是、是企鹅物流的各位啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......啊。我似乎听过这名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "他们就这么......呃，在市区车道上用轿车飘移逼停一辆电动车？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "哎，嗯，常有的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "常有的事啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "知道他们叫什么吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "哎？啊，因为某些工作原因，其实我还挺常见到她们的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "那个开车的帅帅的狼，是德克萨斯。那个拿着锤子追人的很有活力的姐姐，叫可颂......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "（都不像是本名呢。我是不是也要考虑一下......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "啊，那个正在忙着劝架的可爱姐姐是空......以前是个很有名的偶像，果然修道院还是不会听说这种东西的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "偶像？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "就是，呃，歌手，明星，这种感觉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "明星啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "修道院虽然是有一些戒律清规，但其实也不怎么严......至少这几年是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "当明星，是什么感觉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "我也想知道啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "啊，这家酒店的城际网络电视应该可以点播演唱会录像的，要不然直接感受下......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......反正时间还早。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "那、那我来看看......唔......要付费吗......唔？这个是免费节目......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我其实有想过。\n有想过外面的大地，会是我从未见过的模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "啊，已经这么久——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪雉",
      "text": "呼......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "哎呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "抱歉啦......晚安，雪雉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "呼啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "反而看精神了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "电视啊。虽然修道院里也有电视来着......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "通过这么小一个方框，能看到整片大地吗......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......偶像......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不不不我在想什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......卡西米尔的骑士，好像也不错啊......但是骑士竞技总让人觉得哪里怪怪的......有机会的话去看看吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......莱塔尼亚的术师们似乎也很风光，我记得安洁莉卡姐姐结业之后是去了莱塔尼亚吧，听说是在音乐学院进修......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......今晚星星真亮。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "诗人会描摹星星的词汇，旅人会对夜晚思绪万千，而我，已经想好了哪颗星星该以我的名字命名。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "晚上好，小姐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......您、您是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "哦，我之前可看见你从我的酒吧里出来了。那会我正忙着处理一起小小的意外。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "呃......可那不是峯驰物流的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "欧厄尔？那头蠢牛买下来了是不假，但我可还是那里唯一的酒保！酒吧的灵魂就是酒保！我就是它的灵魂！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "哦......等等，等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "什么？是假货？被掉包了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "那还犹豫什么，炸烂他们的船！对！我说的！什么？当然要带上我，你们要吃独食吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "（这怎么看都是非法的吧——！？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "欧厄尔和你说了什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "我怎么会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "哦，我知道，无非又是借着各种合作项目试着找出一种可能性吧。真辛苦他啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "这片大地很精彩，小姑娘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "怎么突然——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "但目前的你，缺乏一些开创性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "没事，我看你挺顺眼的，毕竟保罗·兰登是个好小伙子，我喜欢他放下铳拿起笔的样子！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克萨斯",
      "text": "找到他们了，老板。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "等——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "text": "事不宜迟！该让他们沉进河底了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "欸......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "保罗·兰登......修道院创始人？那个奇怪的人在说什么玩意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......原来也有这样的人吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......欧厄尔先生，虽然很失礼，但我在离开龙门前，有个问题无论如何都想问。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "您说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "为什么总是在这家酒吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哈哈哈......我刚从某个熟人那里把这里买下来，我很中意这个氛围，不嘈杂，不肮脏，光鲜亮丽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "酒吧一般不是这样的，至少在龙门是这样，不知道拉特兰是......不过修士应该和酒吧无缘吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "也不完全是，礼拜日的修士宿舍基本和酒吧没太大区别。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哈哈，我算是明白，为何我和席德佳修士很聊得来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "不过最重要的是，我在某个时刻突然非常中意这个酒吧的名字——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "——“大地的尽头”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "此时此刻，我们就在“大地的尽头”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......原来是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "那么，为了这个项目能带来理想的结果，干杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "干杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "启程的时间是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "原定是，明早九点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哦......原定？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......我改主意了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "那无论您做什么打算，需要我们的信使帮助吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......不必。反正这次离开修道院，也不只是为了一两件事而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "更重要的是，我要找到自己的信仰该在何处发挥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "原来如此。您有结论了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......很难说是结论......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不过......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "我想再看看，这片大地其实......比我想的要有趣点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "很有年轻人风范的答案。我也有个小问题想请教修士。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "不敢当，请问吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "您觉得......我们的事业，哪怕在未来，真的能被人所认可吗？拉特兰的其他声音，会不会站在我们的对立面？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "事物的价值不该在发生之前就去决定，至少，我们会选择对万事万物都尊敬一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "这也是修道院的信条？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "只是拉特兰的人之常情。还是说，欧厄尔先生只是想考验一下如今兰登修道院的态度？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哪里。我只是好奇我如今的合作对象是抱着怎样的心态工作的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "我当然不会怀疑自己的生意。只是，当有些事情超出生意的范畴之后，我就不得不在意他人的意见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "您怎么看？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......兰登修道院有一个寓言。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "说拉特兰的某座教堂里，有一副恢弘的壁画，描绘了古代英杰们为信仰而战的故事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "从各地而来的艺术家，都来品鉴这幅壁画，他们或赞扬或批判，或是选择了理性的沉默。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "——这时候，从莱塔尼亚某个小地方来了一位暴发户。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "这位暴发户体态臃肿，不愿爬上教堂的阶梯，于是他就远远望向教堂的窗户，隔着窗户，他看到了画中的一只畸形恶兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "于是立刻，这位商人开始诋毁这幅壁画，他先说圣洁的拉特兰竟然摆出这种丑恶的画作，有辱风气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "随后又说就算是这只恶兽，也有诸多不可取之处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "恶兽？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "殊不知他所看到的并非壁画里的恶兽，而是教堂摆件和烛台的剪影恰巧给了他这样的错觉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "他甚至都登不上大雅之堂，却能从他所见的浅薄碎片中，拆解出更浅薄的见识。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "您觉得，问题来自哪里？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "——傲慢，和偏见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "这则寓言的名字就叫做《傲慢的恶兽》。如果真要问一句“教堂凭什么要修建那么高的楼梯”，那的确也是一种傲慢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "您所想做的事情，就是打碎所有的傲慢，或是至少，在各国、各地、各种族之间不可调和的傲慢中，通过信使这份天职找出一条道路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "这其中，甚至包括了自然与生命的傲慢——天灾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......说实在的，我觉得这很难。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "总得有人去做那个垫脚石。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......这也是我放心的一点，谈钱的时候，咱们就该谈钱，现在和欧厄尔先生您可不只是在谈钱......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "我们在谈一份不错的事业。我对您的执行力深感钦佩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哈哈哈，您是这么想的，我就彻底放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "有机会的话，带我那儿子去趟拉特兰吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "当然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "毕竟自从和莫斯提马有过接触以后，他眼里的“信使”这个概念，也就不再那么狭隘了，挺好——嗯？您怎么这幅表情？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......好像听到了一个不太能忽视的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哦？原来她那么有名？我以为她的名声还是局限在信使业内的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......不过她被流放之后，我也没怎么听说过她的事情了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "萨科塔在哪里都能活得很好吧，毕竟是萨科塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "哈哈，说的是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "......对了，大帝让我把这个交给你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "唔？大帝？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "一个很厉害的家伙。虽然很不着调，但绝对靠谱。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "......这是......通讯地址？这是家......公司？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "text": "罗......罗德岛......是这么念？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "欧厄尔",
      "text": "啊......偶尔也得相信大帝挑合伙人的品味，也可以相信我，他们和这片大地一样精彩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
